  T("score", "Score a draft", "How on-brand is it?", "🎯", [LONG("draft", "Draft to score", "Paste the draft…")],
    "Score this draft against the profile brand voice: {draft}. kv (overall score /100, tone match, vocabulary match, rhythm match, banned words found), a table of flagged lines (Line | Problem | Fix), a checklist of edits to make, and a callout on whether it's ready to ship.", "kv, table, checklist, callout", "Score it", "Judging the vibe…"),
